flowchart LR
  a["A change reaches your code"] --> b["Upgrade transaction<br/>manifest and lockfile with the ecosystem's own tool"]
  b --> c["Deterministic edits<br/>model swaps (any language)<br/>renames and import rewrites (npm)"]
  c --> v1{"Your checks, before vs after<br/>in the sandbox"}
  v1 -->|pass| pr
  v1 -->|fail| agent["Nemotron 3 Ultra agent<br/>read · search · lookup_docs · edit · run_check<br/>up to 24 steps per attempt"]
  agent --> v2{"Checks pass?"}
  v2 -->|"no, attempts left (4 max; a fresh plan after 2)"| agent
  v2 -->|yes| review["Review pass<br/>behaviour kept, tests not weakened"]
  review -->|"problems, once"| agent
  review --> pr["Pull request decided by the evidence<br/>ready when verified · draft with the reason · issue for a person"]
  v2 -->|out of attempts| pr
